        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7819, Traditional Arched Cabinet Knob Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA traditional cabinet rose such as this can do a lot to add character to any room. The arched ends draw your eye inward toward the cabinet knob of your choice. The Arched Cabinet Knob Backplate is available in 8 finishes, some classic and some contemporary so you will be sure to find the perfect match for your decor. It has a 3-1/2 inch length, making it the ideal statement piece--large enough to command attention but not so much so that it appears oversized for most applications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-7819, Small Backplate with One Hole:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BP-1789-finish.jpg?v=1704354609\" width=\"593\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
